            <div xml:id="d1784">

                <pb facs="1452" n="1336" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1336"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.1611/26.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister of Salvador</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 8, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of the 25th ultimo in which you request the designation of
                    a time when the President will receive you as Envoy Extraordinary and Minister
                    Plenipotentiary on Special Mission for the purpose of conveying to the President
                    the expression of the gratitude of the Government of Salvador for the visit of
                    the Secretary of State to that country, and to inform you that the President has
                    been pleased to designate Friday, the 10th instant, at 2.35 o’clock p.m., as the
                    day and hour when he will receive you for this purpose.</p>
                <p>Mr. Chandler Hale, the Third Assistant Secretary of State, will meet you at the
                    White House and present you to the President in your special capacity.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington Wilson</hi>,</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
